  ('24c0e846-c9e3-4a32-8569-9dc979ac998a', 'B', 'partial_truth', $a$Correctly classifies the oxide as acidic and runs the full calculation but treats the strong oxyacid as monoprotic, dropping the factor of 2 for the second proton.$a$),
